SUMMARY:Perseid Meteor Shower Stargazing Party
DESCRIPTION:[vc_row][vc_column width=”1/1″][vc_column_text uncode_shortcode_id=”907737″]Join us at Millport Conservancy for an unforgettable Perseid Meteor Shower Stargazing Party—right during its dazzling peak. \nGet ready for one of the most spectacular sky shows of the year!\nWhen: Wednesday\, August 12 | 8 PM–11 PM\nWhere: Millport Conservancy\, Lititz\, PA. Just minutes from Lancaster—yet light-years away from skyglow!\nCost: FREE \nThe Perseid meteor shower is famous for producing up to 100 meteors per hour\, including brilliant fireballs—flashes of light so bright they can rival Venus in the night sky. These “shooting stars” seem to originate from the constellation Perseus in the northeastern sky\, and will be visible with the naked eye\, even amidst some lunar light pollution. \nWhat to Expect: \n\nA wide-open view of the night sky with minimal light pollution\nNaked-eye stargazing—binoculars welcome\, but not needed\nGuided instruction from North Museum astronomy educators\nMythology stories from the Perseus constellation\nCareer advice for budding astronomers and STEM students\nCertificate of Completion and a great addition to your first resume!\n\nWho Should Come:\nAstronomy fans\, families\, friends\, middle & high school students—anyone curious about the night sky. \nWhat to Bring:\nBlankets\, camp chairs\, warm drinks\, and your curiosity! Binoculars  are welcome but not necessary. \n🌧️Rain or Cloudy Sky:\nIn the event of rain or a cloudy sky\, the star party will be moved to the museum for a FREE live stream in the planetarium. \nFREE FOR EVERYONE! \nDon’t miss this rare chance to connect with the cosmos—and your fellow stargazers.\n[/vc_column_text][vc_button button_color=”color-395923″ size=”btn-xl” radius=”btn-circle” outline=”yes” border_width=”0″ link=”url:https%3A%2F%2F68796.blackbaudhosting.com%2F68796%2FStargazing-Party-Perseid-Meteor-Shower-2026″ button_color_type=”uncode-palette” uncode_shortcode_id=”203547″]Click to RSVP[/vc_button][/vc_column][/vc_row]
URL:https://northmuseum.org/events/perseid-meteor-shower-stargazing-party/
LOCATION:Millport Conservancy\, 737 E. Millport Rd.\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://northmuseum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/perseid-meteor-shower-event.png
END:VEVENT
